{"id": 32, "text": "Hmm, let me think about that for a a second.", "words": ["Hmm,", "let", "me", "think", "about", "that", "for", "a", "a", "second."], "labels": ["D", "K", "K", "K", "K", "K", "K", "D", "K", "K"]}
{"id": 33, "text": "I mean, it's not a big deal either way.", "words": ["I", "mean,", "it's", "not", "a", "big", "deal", "either", "way."], "labels": ["D", "D", "K", "K", "K", "K", "K", "K", "K"]}
